        "explanation": "The doctor provides red flags including chest pain, dyspnea, and facial/neck swelling.",
        "quote": "如果出现这些情况，不要等复诊，及时急诊：胸痛明显加重、呼吸困难、脸颈部突然肿胀、持续高热、咯血、晕厥。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00161",
        "explanation": "The doctor addresses practical barriers like document gathering, medication, and transportation.",
        "quote": "资料袋今晚就放门口：出院记录、片子/光盘、报告、身份证、医保卡、手机和充电器；"
      }
    ]
  },
