          "event_id": "lite_evt_00005",
          "explanation": "The doctor uses the clinical workspace to retrieve records before making case-specific claims.",
          "quote": "医生主动调阅了临床工作台。 可见既往/CareLoop 中心医院记录 5 条。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor correctly used the workspace to ground advice, separated confirmed from uncertain items, and did not infer pathology from incomplete information.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00161",
          "explanation": "The doctor advises against self-executing unclear peri-operative orders and warns about medication, fasting, and skin-prep instructions.",
          "quote": "平时正在吃的药，明早哪些照常吃，哪些先停；"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor warned against self-administration of hospital-only orders and addressed medication safety for the waiting period.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00100",
          "explanation": "The doctor asks the family to core-check the responsible next contact and provides a concrete sequence.",
          "quote": "你明天问的时候，核心就问这几句：\n- “患者目前是否已有病理结果？如果有，哪里领取或哪里能看到？”\n- “下一步是先胸外科门诊复诊，还是等住院通知直接入院？”"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor identified the responsible service (thoracic surgery) and provided a concrete next-step sequence with required materials.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00039",
          "explanation": "The doctor gives clear return precautions relevant to the mediastinal mass and peri-operative waiting period.",
          "quote": "如果出现这些情况，不要等复诊，及时急诊：胸痛明显加重、呼吸困难、脸颈部突然肿胀、持续高热、咯血、晕厥。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provided specific red flags and stated that severe symptoms should prompt emergency care.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00120",
          "explanation": "The doctor checks practical barriers and obtains a teach-back from the family about next contact, materials, and when to seek urgent care.",
          "quote": "你们现在这样理解是对的，而且已经抓住重点了。接下来这3到5个工作日，就按这个简化版执行..."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor verified the family could execute the follow-up plan, obtained a teach-back, and framed closure as a safe interim transition with unresolved items for the treating team.",
